  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The friendly counter",
    "overview": "A billing counter as friendly as a wallet app. Warm off-white canvas, borderless white 24 px cards, pastel tints that each carry one meaning (gold = gold, silver = silver, lavender = focus, mint = paid, peach = people, rose = money owed), and near-black ink reserved for the one decision on screen: the primary pill, the hero figure, the floating totals dock and the phone bottom bar. Figtree throughout with tabular figures so every rupee and gram lines up. Logo: Coin B, an ink stem with a gold and a silver coin as the bowls of a B."
  }
